{"name":"Five-door PAX wardrobe, Finchley (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (9 Oct 2026) from the job photos at IKEA PAX standard sizes (Raf: 'If you don't know use standard size'; nothing measured): three PAX frames 2364 high and 580 deep (one 500 wide, two 1000 wide), hardboard backs; five panelled doors 495 x 2290 (frame with three recessed panels: tall top, small middle, long bottom), gold bar handles on doors 2 and 5 where the pairs meet, as in the photos; door 1 on the narrow frame. Narrow frame: five shelves. Wide frames: a top shelf with a rail under it, a shelf over three drawers. A left end panel to the ceiling, a filler over the doors to a 2500 ceiling and a filler to the side wall make it a built-in. Back and side walls are room context. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X along the wall, Y out from the room, Z up.","materials":{"PAX white":{"color":[242,242,238],"roughness":0.6},"Hardboard back":{"color":[236,236,232],"roughness":0.8},"Rail":{"color":[190,193,197],"roughness":0.35,"metalness":0.7},"Door, white":{"color":[238,238,234],"roughness":0.55},"Handle, gold":{"color":[214,176,88],"roughness":0.35,"metalness":0.4},"Wall":{"color":[236,234,228],"roughness":0.95}},"moves":{"Door 1 (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[20.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":95},"at":[0.0,0.42],"with":["Door 1 panels"]},"Door 2 (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[520.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":100},"at":[0.04,0.45999999999999996],"with":["Door 2 panels","Handle, door 2: bar","Handle, door 2: post top","Handle, door 2: post bottom"]},"Door 3 (hinged right)":{"hinge":{"origin":[1515.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":90},"at":[0.08,0.5],"with":["Door 3 panels"]},"Door 4 (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[1520.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":90},"at":[0.12,0.54],"with":["Door 4 panels"]},"Door 5 (hinged right)":{"hinge":{"origin":[2515.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":90},"at":[0.16,0.58],"with":["Door 5 pan